<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-NORTH WEST BEAT TONGA 46-6 IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NORTH WEST BEAT TONGA 46-6 IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>POTCHEFSTROOM, South Africa 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>North West beat Tonga 46-6 (halftime 20-3) in their rugby union tour match at Olen Park on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>North West - Tries: Tenk Hendriks (2), Rudi Muller, Markus van Greunen, A.J.de Jager, Reagan Anderson, Johan van der Berg. Conversions: Bertus Kruger (4). Penalty: Kruger.</p>
<p>Tonga - Penalties: Gustavo Tonga (2).</p>
